Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这是一行代码，是哈佛的一位授课老师在课堂上现场 commit 的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here is a line of code that a Harvard instructor committed, live, in class.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.06,0:00:10.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个点到原点的距离，是 x 的平方加 y 的平方，再开平方\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The distance from a point to the origin is the square root of x squared plus y squared.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.94,0:00:13.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这一行算的却是它的两倍再开平方\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This line takes the square root of twice that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.74,0:00:16.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,什么都没崩溃；应用照常启动了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Nothing crashed; the app started fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.40,0:00:18.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只是答案错了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The answer was just wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.27,0:00:19.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你输入 git commit\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}You type git commit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.95,0:00:24.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这个 commit 生成之前，谁有权说不，它们又到底能抓到什么？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Before that commit exists, who gets to say no, and what can they actually catch?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.05,0:00:28.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上给能说不的东西起了个名字\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture has a word for whoever can say no:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.04,0:00:30.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,门禁，也就是任何会失败、能拦住你的东西\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a gate, anything that can fail and stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.22,0:00:34.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,今天我们就在你的电脑上搭一个门禁，看着它拒绝一次 commit\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Today we build one on your machine, and watch it refuse a commit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.73,0:00:41.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先退一步看：在一个机器学习系统里，模型只是一大张格子里的几块\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step back once: in a machine learning system, the model is a few tiles in a big grid;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.31,0:00:42.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,其余都是工程\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the rest is engineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.22,0:00:44.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,今天讲的就是这些工程\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Today is that engineering:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.86,0:00:48.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,测试、格式化工具、linter，还有运行它们的 hook\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}tests, formatters, linters, and the hook that runs them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.65,0:00:53.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,想跟着做，你需要自己 clone 一份 cheese-app-ci-cd\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}To follow along you need your own clone of cheese-app-ci-cd,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.17,0:00:56.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,开着 Docker Desktop，还要有 Python 3.9 及以上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Docker Desktop running, and Python 3.9 or newer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.10,0:00:59.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,不用云，不用凭据，没有账单\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}No cloud, no credentials, no bill:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.37,0:01:02.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一切都在你的笔记本上跑，这正是重点\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}everything runs on your laptop, which is the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.02,0:01:07.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,左上角的进度条显示我们在 README 的哪一步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The tracker in the top left shows which README step we are on;
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.19,0:01:10.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,今天一共 6 段：4 段来自 cheese 的 README\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}6 sections today: 4 from the cheese README,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.08,0:01:12.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,1 段是客座讲座，1 段是清理\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}1 for the guest lecture, 1 for cleanup.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.02,0:01:16.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,看到黄色的 your turn 标签，就暂停，自己跑这条命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}When the yellow your-turn tag appears, pause and run the command.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.12,0:01:20.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,灰色的 extra 标签表示这个检查 README 里没有\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A gray extra tag marks a check not in the README.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.74,0:01:23.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每条命令都在学习指南里，链接在下方\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every command is in the study guide, linked below.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.80,0:01:26.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 bug 是真实的历史\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The bug is real history.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.87,0:01:29.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 repo 自己的 log 讲了整个故事\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This repo's own log tells the story:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.37,0:01:33.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先是故意加回来的乱代码，然后是一次崩溃，再是一次修复\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}messy code re-added on purpose, then a crash, then a fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:36.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接着课堂演示把那个错的平方根混了进去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then the class demo slipped the wrong square root in,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.46,0:01:38.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,后来又被 revert 拿掉了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the revert took it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.28,0:01:39.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外跑一下 git log\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra git log
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.78,0:01:44.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,确认 clone 下来的正是最后那个 commit，2025 年 11 月的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}confirms the clone sits at that last commit, from November 2025.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.83,0:01:46.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,想象一个点：x 是 3，y 是 4\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Picture the point (3, 4).
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.18,0:01:51.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它到原点的真实距离是 5，也就是这个圆的半径\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its true distance from the origin is 5, the radius of this circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.87,0:01:58.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有 bug 的那一行返回 50 的平方根，大约 7.07：冲出了这个圆\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The buggy line returns the square root of 50, about 7.07: it overshoots the circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.04,0:02:02.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没崩溃，没报错，只有一个错的数字\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}No crash, no error message, only a wrong number.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.55,0:02:05.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有一个现成的测试早就知道正确答案\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One existing test already knew the right answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.81,0:02:09.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它让应用算 x 是 3、y 是 4 的距离\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It asks the app for the distance of (3, 4) and insists on exactly 5.0.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.03,0:02:11.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,并且坚持结果必须正好是 5.0\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It asks the app for the distance of (3, 4) and insists on exactly 5.0.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.96,0:02:14.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,测试就是可执行的规格说明\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A test is an executable specification,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.46,0:02:18.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个测试本来会在任何人看到演示之前就说不\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and this one would have said no before anyone saw the demo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.58,0:02:22.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,测试失败时，有两个嫌疑人：代码和测试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}When a test fails, there are two suspects, the code and the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.49,0:02:26.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上的规则是：先相信测试，去改代码\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture's rule: first believe the test, and fix the code.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.41,0:02:31.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为了迁就 bug 去改测试，规格说明就变成了日记\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Rewriting the test to match a bug turns your specification into a diary.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.73,0:02:33.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,什么值得测试？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What is worth testing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:38.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上把输入分进三个托盘：正常、边缘和非法\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture sorts inputs into three trays: normal, edge, and invalid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.47,0:02:42.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,对这里的 power 函数来说，2 的 3 次方是正常输入\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}For the power function here, 2 to the power 3 is normal;
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.29,0:02:45.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,指数为零、无穷大和非数值都是边缘情况\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}zero exponents, infinity and not a number are edges.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.15,0:02:50.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,至于非法输入，pytest.raises 把测试反过来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And for invalid input, pytest.raises inverts the test:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.29,0:02:54.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只有对字符串调用 power 时抛出 TypeError，测试才通过\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}it passes only if power on a string raises a TypeError.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.53,0:02:58.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在用一个请求来讲课上的词汇\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now the lecture's vocabulary,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.05,0:03:02.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,GET euclidean distance，x 是 3，y 是 4\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}on one request: GET /euclidean_distance/?x=3&y=4.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.62,0:03:06.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在处理函数里，求 x 的平方是一次调用：power，参数是 3 和 2\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Inside the handler, squaring x is one call, power(3, 2).
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.22,0:03:11.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,单元测试完全绕开应用，只单独调用这一个函数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A unit test skips the app entirely and calls that one function alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.81,0:03:14.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它很快，而且失败时你知道该去哪儿找\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It is fast, and when it fails you know where to look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.73,0:03:17.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,集成测试把我们自己的几个部分连起来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An integration test wires several of our parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.06,0:03:22.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,测试客户端把请求直接交给 FastAPI 应用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The test client hands the request straight to the FastAPI app,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.61,0:03:26.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在同一个进程里：路由、校验、处理函数和 power 全都跑了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}in process: routing, validation, handler and power all run,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.94,0:03:29.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,但没有服务器，也没有网络\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}but no server and no network.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.39,0:03:33.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,录制时，这里有 10 个这样的测试，不到一秒就跑完\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Ten of those run here in under a second, at the time of recording.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.35,0:03:36.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,系统测试把运行中的程序当成一个黑盒\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A system test treats the running program as a black box.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.23,0:03:42.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,请求离开测试，穿过一根真实的网线到达 port 9000\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The request leaves the test, crosses a real network wire to port 9000,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.55,0:03:44.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再以 JSON 的形式回来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and comes back as JSON.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.61,0:03:48.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它是最诚实的测试，也是最慢、最脆弱的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It is the most honest test, and the slowest and most fragile.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.78,0:03:51.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,叠起来，就是测试金字塔\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Stacked, that is the testing pyramid:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.23,0:03:55.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,底层是大量便宜的单元测试，顶上是少量昂贵的系统测试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}many cheap unit tests at the bottom, few expensive system tests on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.17,0:03:58.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上还给了一个更锐利的视角：一条边界\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture adds a sharper lens: a border.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.26,0:04:02.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个测试是 hermetic 的，指的是只有你的代码能让它失败\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A test is hermetic when only your code can make it fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.99,0:04:06.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,单元测试和集成测试都在这条边界之内\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Unit and integration tests live inside that border.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.81,0:04:08.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,系统测试跨过了它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The system test crosses it:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.52,0:04:12.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一台运行中的服务器可能会挂掉，原因却不是你的 bug\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a live server can be down for reasons that are not your bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.55,0:04:17.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有两类测试只占淡淡的两行：一类是冒烟测试，只问它有没有响应\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two more kinds get faint rows: a smoke test, which only asks whether it answers,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.72,0:04:21.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,另一类是验收测试，这个项目暂时还没有\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and acceptance tests, which this project lacks, for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.66,0:04:23.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,关于类型说一句\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One note about kinds:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.14,0:04:27.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,测试属于哪一类，看的是实际运行了什么，而不是它放在哪个目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a test's kind is named by what runs, not by its folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.36,0:04:31.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 repo 的系统测试文件管自己叫集成测试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This repo's system test file calls itself integration tests,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.78,0:04:34.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它的 pytest 配置还定义了一些 marker\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and its pytest config defines markers,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.58,0:04:37.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,也就是用来挑选测试的记号，却没人用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}labels for selecting tests, that nobody uses;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.90,0:04:40.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,marker 会在客座讲座里回来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}markers return in the guest lecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.80,0:04:43.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后一张图：一张空表，四列\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Last picture: an empty table, four columns.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.04,0:04:48.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,检查什么，怎么检查，用哪条命令，以及是不是每次 commit 都跑\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What is checked, how, with which command, and does it run on every commit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.57,0:04:50.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一部分会把它填满\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Part 1 fills it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.02,0:04:52.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,该动手敲了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Time to type.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.45,0:04:56.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 只说从你的仓库 clone 或下载\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README says clone or download from your repository,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.13,0:04:58.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没给地址，所以这里给出 repo 的地址\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}without an address, so here is the repo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.12,0:05:02.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先 clone，再 cd 进 cheese-app-ci-cd\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Clone it, then cd into cheese-app-ci-cd.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.56,0:05:04.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，两条都跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run both.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.10,0:05:07.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外看一圈，README 里没有这一步：ls -la\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra look around, not in the README: ls -la.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.26,0:05:12.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,今天的东西全在这儿：三个测试目录都在 tests 下面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Everything today is here: three test folders under tests,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.20,0:05:14.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有一个 pytest 配置、一个 pre-commit 配置\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a pytest config, a pre-commit config,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.75,0:05:18.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,以及把它们打包进一个 image 的 Dockerfile\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the Dockerfile that bakes them into one image.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.45,0:05:22.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在是 README 的第一条命令：sh docker-shell.sh\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now the README's first command: sh docker-shell.sh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.95,0:05:26.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它会构建 image，录制时大约要一分钟\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It builds the image, about a minute at the time of recording,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.48,0:05:29.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后把你放进 container 里的一个 shell\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and drops you into a shell inside the container.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.59,0:05:31.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.06,0:05:34.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,看一下提示符：用户是 app，不是 root\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Read the prompt: the user is app, not root,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.05,0:05:36.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且 ID 每次运行都会变\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the ID changes every run.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.52,0:05:43.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在里面启动服务器，命令是 uvicorn api.service:app\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Inside, start the server: uvicorn api.service:app
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.64,0:05:48.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,--host 0.0.0.0 --port 9000 --reload\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}--host 0.0.0.0 --port 9000 --reload.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.46,0:05:51.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,等它显示 Application startup complete\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}When it says Application startup complete,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.35,0:05:54.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,就在浏览器里打开 README 的三个 URL\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}open the three README URLs in your browser;
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.15,0:05:55.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，照着做\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}pause and do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.74,0:06:01.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这里在笔记本电脑上另开一个终端，用三次 curl 代替浏览器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here, from a second terminal on the laptop, three curl calls stand in for the browser:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.02,0:06:03.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,欢迎信息、health，还有距离的结果\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}welcome, health, and the distance answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.92,0:06:09.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有一个小疏漏：README 说这个接口返回 5.0\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One small gap: the README says this endpoint returns 5.0.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.78,0:06:12.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,实际上它返回的是一个 JSON 对象\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Really it returns a JSON object
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.28,0:06:16.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,其中 distance 字段是 5.0，代码里写得很清楚\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}whose distance field is 5.0, as the code shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.52,0:06:20.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 Ctrl-C 停掉服务器，再输入 exit\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Stop the server with Ctrl-C, then type exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.10,0:06:26.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,因为这个 shell 脚本用了 --rm，什么都不会留下\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Because the shell script used --rm, nothing is left behind;
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.35,0:06:29.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外跑一下 docker ps -a 就能确认\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}an extra docker ps -a confirms it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.70,0:06:34.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先提醒一句，很快就会用上：你的文件没有挂载进这个 container\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One warning that pays off soon: your files are not mounted into this container.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.82,0:06:38.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,参数 --reload 盯着的是打包进 image 的那份副本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The --reload flag watches the copy baked into the image,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.48,0:06:42.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以你在笔记本上改了什么，在重新构建之前都不起作用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so an edit on your laptop changes nothing until you rebuild.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.45,0:06:48.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 的 Part 2 用两个工具找代码质量问题，这两个可别搞混\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README's Part 2 hunts for quality issues with two tools not to confuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.59,0:06:53.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,格式化工具把代码改写成统一的排版，从不改变行为\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A formatter rewrites code into one layout and never changes behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.48,0:06:55.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 linter 只负责报告\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A linter only reports:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.04,0:06:58.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,风格问题、可能的 bug、需要人来处理的地方\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}style issues, likely bugs, things needing a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.98,0:07:00.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先格式化，再 lint\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Format first, then lint.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.57,0:07:05.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先构建 image：cheese-app-api:local\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}First build the image, cheese-app-api:local.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.56,0:07:06.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每一步都显示 CACHED\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every step says CACHED:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.93,0:07:09.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那个 shell 脚本已经构建过这个 Dockerfile 了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the shell script already built this Dockerfile.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.06,0:07:11.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.45,0:07:14.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在跑 linter，在 image 里面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now the linter, inside the image:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.89,0:07:18.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,flake8，--max-line-length 设成 120，检查 api 目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}flake8 --max-line-length=120 api/.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.75,0:07:20.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.22,0:07:24.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 utils.py 里发现两个问题，逗号后面少了空格\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two findings in utils.py, a missing space after a comma,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.30,0:07:27.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有空行太多：都是故意留下的乱代码\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and too many blank lines: mess left on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.97,0:07:30.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后是 black，用 --check 和 --diff 模式\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then black, in --check --diff mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.33,0:07:31.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.81,0:07:36.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它说有 2 个文件会被重新格式化，不只是 utils.py\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It reports 2 files would be reformatted, not just utils.py.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.52,0:07:42.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这条命令没给 black 指定宽度，所以它退回默认的 88\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This command gives black no width, so it falls back to its default of 88
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.18,0:07:46.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把 service.py 里一行 95 个字符的代码也折了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and also folds a 95 character line in service.py.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.28,0:07:47.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,看好这个陷阱\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Watch the trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.69,0:07:51.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,宽度 88 时，black 把那一行折成三行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}At width 88, black folds that line into three;
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.63,0:07:53.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,宽度 120 时，又展开回一行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}at 120, it unfolds to one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.18,0:07:56.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这里的 hook 和 CI 都用 120\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The hook and CI here both use 120,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.74,0:07:59.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,但 README 里有几条命令没给宽度\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}but several README commands pass no width,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.91,0:08:02.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,于是同一个文件得到不同的结论\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so the same file gets different answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.24,0:08:06.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,要么每次都传 120，要么在配置里一次写好\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Always pass 120, or set it once in config.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.12,0:08:16.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Option B 在你的笔记本上跑同样的检查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Option B runs the same checks on your laptop:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.27,0:08:20.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 pip 在宿主机上装 black 和 flake8\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}install black and flake8 with pip, on the host,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.61,0:08:24.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,录制时分别是 26.10.1 和 7.4.1\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}26.10.1 and 7.4.1 at the time of recording.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.90,0:08:26.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.37,0:08:30.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果 pip 拒绝，报 externally-managed-environment\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If pip refuses with externally-managed-environment,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.17,0:08:31.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Homebrew 的 Python 就会这样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}as Homebrew Pythons do,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.88,0:08:35.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那就用第 1 讲的任意一个虚拟环境，或者 pipx\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}use any lecture 1 virtual environment, or pipx;
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.38,0:08:37.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,学习指南里有那一行命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the study guide has the one-liner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.15,0:08:41.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,本地的 flake8 用默认的 79\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The local flake8, at its default of 79,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.33,0:08:45.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,多报了第三个问题，就是那行 95 个字符的代码\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}adds a third finding, that same 95 character line;
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.40,0:08:49.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,本地的 black 要改的还是那两个文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}local black wants the same two files changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.39,0:08:50.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，两条都跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run both.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.93,0:08:53.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,格式化工具能修好什么？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What can a formatter fix?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.79,0:08:57.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 repo 历史里那个乱糟糟的 service.py 上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On the messy service.py from the repo's history,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.18,0:09:01.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,black 几乎扫掉了所有问题，正好剩下 2 个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}black sweeps away almost every finding, and exactly 2 survive:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.57,0:09:03.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个没用到的 import\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}an unused import,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.07,0:09:08.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,格式化工具删不掉；还有一个带引号的长句子，black 不能改写它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which a formatter cannot delete, and a long quoted sentence black must not rewrite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.96,0:09:10.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上是手动把这两个修好的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The class fixed both by hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.90,0:09:16.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在成批跑测试之前，先认识一下找测试的那台机器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Before running tests in bulk, meet the machine that finds them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.80,0:09:23.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,配置文件 pytest.ini 定下规则：文件名以 test 下划线开头\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The config file pytest.ini sets the rules: files named test_*.py,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.09,0:09:27.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,类名以 Test 开头，函数名以 test 下划线开头\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}classes named Test*, functions named test_*.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.66,0:09:32.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它还给每次运行加上一些选项，要记住的是 -ra\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It also adds options to every run, and the one to remember is -ra,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.39,0:09:35.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,凡是没有干脆通过的，都会列进这份摘要\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the summary of everything not plainly passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.87,0:09:38.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,看收集器扫过 tests 目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Watch the collector sweep the tests folder:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.76,0:09:41.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个匹配的名字都亮起来，一共 26 个测试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}every matching name lights up, 26 tests in all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.58,0:09:44.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来想一个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Something to ponder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.25,0:09:47.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 后面有一部分往一个测试文件末尾追加一行 def broken\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A later README part appends the line def broken():
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.67,0:09:51.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,内容是 assert False，想以此让构建失败\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}assert False to a test file, hoping to break the build.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.76,0:09:53.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,单元测试会变红吗？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Will the unit test run go red?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.50,0:10:06.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,不会。看收集器：追加的那个名字一直是暗的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}No. Watch the collector: the appended name stays dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.94,0:10:09.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个名字不匹配 test 下划线加星号\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The name does not match test_*,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.25,0:10:11.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以它从没被收集，也从没运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so it is never collected, never run.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.25,0:10:15.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,想真的让构建失败，就把它叫作 test 下划线 broken\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}To really break the build, call it test_broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.96,0:10:18.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,按约定发现测试，是一把双刃剑\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Discovery by convention cuts both ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.85,0:10:21.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再用 30 秒讲 pytest 的三个动作\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Three more pytest verbs in 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.84,0:10:25.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,普通的 assert 会被改写，失败时两边的值都会显示出来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A plain assert is rewritten so a failure shows both values.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.85,0:10:29.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,对浮点数，pytest.approx 带着容差来比较\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}For floats, pytest.approx compares with a tolerance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.69,0:10:34.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 pytest.raises 只有在里面的代码抛出指定错误时才通过\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And pytest.raises passes only when the block raises the named error:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.41,0:10:36.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,就是前面那个非法输入的托盘\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the invalid tray from earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.73,0:10:40.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上还送了一个礼物，这个 repo 还没用上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One gift from the lecture that this repo does not use yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.72,0:10:45.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,集成测试把测试客户端只建一次，作为模块级的全局变量\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The integration tests build their test client once, as a module global.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.59,0:10:47.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 fixture 会更好\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A fixture would do it better.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.53,0:10:51.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,测试按名字要 client，pytest 负责建好并注入\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A test asks for client by name, and pytest builds and injects it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.07,0:10:56.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有一个设置决定每个测试拿一个新的，还是整次运行共用一个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A setting says whether each test gets a fresh one or the whole run shares one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.94,0:11:01.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 parametrize 把四份副本折成一个函数，带四组输入\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And parametrize folds four copies into one function with four inputs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.65,0:11:07.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Part 3 在应用所在的地方跑测试，也就是 image 里面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Part 3 runs tests where the app lives, inside the image,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.38,0:11:09.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有三条路：每个测试集一条 docker run\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}by three routes: docker run per suite,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.91,0:11:13.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为系统测试起一个运行中的服务器，或者一个交互式 shell\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a live server for the system tests, or an interactive shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.23,0:11:17.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Dockerfile 复制 pyproject.toml\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The Dockerfile copies pyproject.toml
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.04,0:11:20.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,安装依赖，形成一个很厚的层\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and installs the dependencies, one fat layer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.87,0:11:24.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接着四行薄薄的 COPY 把 api 代码、测试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then four thin copy lines bake in the api code,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.25,0:11:27.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,pytest 配置和 entrypoint 打包进去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the tests, the pytest config and the entrypoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.03,0:11:30.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 entrypoint 把 pytest 放进 PATH\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The entrypoint puts pytest on PATH,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.35,0:11:34.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它的 exec 那一行再把 container 交给你传进来的任何命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and its exec line hands the container to whatever command you pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.09,0:11:36.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,靠的是 container 的退出码\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The container's exit code
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.86,0:11:39.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,docker run 才能让 CI 的一个步骤失败\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}is how docker run can fail a CI step.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.72,0:11:45.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再构建一次，全是缓存，然后跑单元测试：docker run --rm\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Build again, all cached, then run the unit tests: docker run --rm,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.51,0:11:49.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,加上 image 名，再加 pytest tests/unit/：11 passed\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the image, pytest tests/unit/: 11 passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.42,0:11:50.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，两条都跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run both.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.97,0:11:54.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,集成测试显示 10 passed, 1 warning\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The integration suite says 10 passed, 1 warning;
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.52,0:11:57.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个测试集一起跑，是 21 passed, 1 warning\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}both suites together, 21 passed, 1 warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.03,0:11:59.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，把它们都跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.61,0:12:02.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那个 1 warning 是 pytest 9 的摘要行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The 1 warning is pytest 9's summary line
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.49,0:12:05.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把这份配置隐藏掉的一个警告也算了进去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}counting a warning this config hides,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.16,0:12:08.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这是录制时的情况：测试相同，结果也相同\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}at the time of recording: same tests, same results.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.08,0:12:13.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在跑覆盖率：单元测试，统计 api 这个包\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now the coverage run: unit tests, measuring the api package.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.69,0:12:15.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.16,0:12:19.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,看 service.py：0%；单元测试从来没有 import 它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Look at service.py: 0 percent; the unit tests never import it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.13,0:12:24.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,覆盖率是一份没人问过的代码行清单，而不是一个分数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Coverage is a list of lines nobody has asked about, not a score.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.78,0:12:26.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先记住这一点\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Hold that thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.20,0:12:28.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,门禁表有了第一行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The gate table gets its first row:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.53,0:12:32.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,单元测试和集成测试，hermetic，一条 docker 命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}unit and integration tests, hermetic, one docker command.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.75,0:12:35.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Option 2 先等等；下一段专门讲它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Option 2 waits; it gets the next scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.65,0:12:38.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Option 3 是同样的事，换成交互式\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Option 3 is the same interactively:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.09,0:12:42.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再跑一次 docker-shell.sh，同样的 pytest 命令，同样的数字\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}docker-shell again, the same pytest commands, the same counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.73,0:12:43.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有一个陷阱\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One trap:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.73,0:12:48.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,HTML 报告生成在一个会被 --rm 删掉的 container 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the HTML report lands inside a container that --rm deletes,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.64,0:12:50.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一 exit 就没了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}gone when you exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.60,0:12:52.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,优先用终端里的报告\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Prefer the terminal report.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.62,0:12:56.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 image 把开发工具当成运行时依赖一起发布\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This image ships its dev tools as runtime dependencies,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.53,0:12:58.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,版本只有下限，没有 lock 文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}open ended pins, no lockfile;
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.59,0:13:02.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,客座讲座则把它们放进依赖组，由一个 lock 文件锁住\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the guest lecture keeps them in groups behind one lockfile.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.11,0:13:06.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README Part 1 里的那句提醒这时用上了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And the warning from the README's Part 1 pays off:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.58,0:13:08.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你在笔记本上改了 utils.py\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}edit utils.py on your laptop,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.59,0:13:11.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 container 测的还是昨天的副本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and this container still tests yesterday's copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.24,0:13:14.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,要么重新构建，要么你测的就是过去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Rebuild, or you test the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.68,0:13:22.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Option 2 是系统测试，也带出课上的问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Option 2 is the system test, and the lecture's question:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.42,0:13:25.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,除了我们的代码，还有别的东西能让它失败吗？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}can anything but our code make it fail?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.34,0:13:29.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在后台启动一个服务器，名字叫 api-server\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Start a live server, detached, named api-server,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.83,0:13:32.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 port 9000，DEV 设成 1\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}on port 9000, with DEV=1.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.49,0:13:34.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你拿回来的只有一个 container ID\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}All you get back is a container ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.28,0:13:36.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.67,0:13:38.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 接着马上就跑测试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README runs the tests immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.31,0:13:40.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们先额外加一步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}We add one extra first:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.77,0:13:44.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个循环不停地 curl health 接口，直到它有回应\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a loop curling the health endpoint until it answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.39,0:13:47.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,CI 也会等，用它自己的办法；很快你就知道为什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}CI waits too, in its own way; you will see why soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.17,0:13:51.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二个额外检查是 docker ps，显示服务器已经起来了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A second extra, docker ps, shows the server up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.58,0:13:53.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在是 README 里的系统测试命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now the README's system command:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.92,0:13:57.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,docker run 加上 --network host，跑 pytest tests/system/\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}docker run --network host, pytest tests/system/.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.75,0:14:01.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,5 passed，这一次请求真的穿过了那根线\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}5 passed, and this time the request really crossed the wire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.63,0:14:03.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.53,0:14:08.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来想一个问题：同一条命令再跑一次，但服务器没在运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Something to ponder: the same command again, with no server running.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.91,0:14:10.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这时 pytest 到底会打印什么？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What exactly does pytest print?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.80,0:14:23.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 的下一步正好回答它：停掉并删除服务器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README's next step answers it: stop and remove the server.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.09,0:14:27.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，照着做；这次清理顺便就是我们的实验\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and do it; the cleanup doubles as our experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.72,0:14:30.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,答案在这儿，作为额外的一次运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here is the answer, as an extra run.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.49,0:14:33.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,1 passed, 4 skipped，标题行还是绿的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}1 passed, 4 skipped, and the headline is still green.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.29,0:14:36.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,四个灰点，不算失败\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Four gray dots, not failures.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.61,0:14:40.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只有 -ra 的摘要说了实话\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Only the summary from -ra tells the truth:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.39,0:14:44.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,SKIPPED，API not running at localhost:9000\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}SKIPPED, API not running at localhost:9000.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.50,0:14:45.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么会跳过？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Why does it skip?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.02,0:14:50.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,测试文件只探测一次服务器，就在 pytest 收集这个模块的时候\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The test file probes the server once, when pytest collects the module.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.84,0:14:56.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这一次的结果决定了整个类：服务器晚一秒起来，就已经太晚了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That one answer marks the whole class: a server that comes up a second late is too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.62,0:15:02.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,拔了电池的烟雾报警器永远不会响，但这不等于没有着火\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A smoke detector with its battery removed will never beep, and that is not the same as no fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.70,0:15:07.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在边界图上，有 22 个测试在里面：上一段的 21 个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On the border picture, 22 tests live inside: the 21 from last scene,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.57,0:15:11.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,加上系统测试目录里那个从来不需要服务器的测试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}plus the one system folder test that never needed the server.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.26,0:15:13.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这 4 个站在外面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}These 4 stand outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.20,0:15:17.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,诚实的办法是用一个 marker，运行时必须特意选中它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The honest remedy is a marker the run must select on purpose;
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.91,0:15:19.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,客座讲座会演示\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the guest lecture shows it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.87,0:15:23.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,CI 的做法很响亮：它先 curl 服务器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}CI's version is loud: it curls the server first,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.24,0:15:26.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,服务器要是没起来，整个任务直接失败\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and if the server is down, the whole job fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.85,0:15:30.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,系统测试这一行写进门禁表，但放在闸机外面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The system row enters the gate table outside the turnstile:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.82,0:15:33.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,不是每次 commit 都跑，也不是 hermetic 的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}not on every commit, not hermetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.18,0:15:35.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Part 4 装上门禁\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Part 4 installs the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.23,0:15:40.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 container 外面执行 pip install pre-commit\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Outside the container, pip install pre-commit,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.01,0:15:42.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,版本 4.7.0 是录制时的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}4.7.0 at the time of recording;
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.55,0:15:46.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后在 repo 根目录运行 pre-commit install\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then, from the repo root, pre-commit install:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.25,0:15:48.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,.git 里就多了一个 hook 文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a hook file now sits in .git.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.95,0:15:50.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，两条都跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run both.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.48,0:15:53.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Git 在每次 commit 之前都会运行这个 hook 文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Git runs that hook file before every commit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.53,0:15:58.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它放在 .git 里，从来不会被 commit：每个 clone 都要重新安装\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It lives in .git, which is never committed: every clone installs it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.80,0:16:02.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它把工作交给 pre-commit，再由 pre-commit 读取 repo 的配置\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It hands over to pre-commit, which reads the repo's config.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.67,0:16:08.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,配置里列了九个 hook：七个卫生检查，从空白字符到私钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The config names nine hooks: seven hygiene guards, from whitespace to private keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.49,0:16:11.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再加上 black 和 flake8，宽度都是 120\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then black and flake8, both at width 120,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.88,0:16:17.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,都只看 src 下面的 Python 文件：测试代码从来不做 lint\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}both seeing only Python files under src: the tests are never linted.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.73,0:16:20.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在照 README 做一次 commit，工作区是干净的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now the README's commit, on a clean tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.53,0:16:21.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.00,0:16:25.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一次运行会下载每个 hook pin 住的环境\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The first run downloads each hook's pinned environment,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.34,0:16:28.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,录制时还多了一条无害的警告\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}plus a harmless warning at the time of recording.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.63,0:16:32.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接着每个 hook 都显示 Skipped，git 说 nothing to commit\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then every hook says skipped and git says nothing to commit:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.23,0:16:35.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,hook 只检查暂存的文件，而什么都没暂存\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}hooks check staged files, and nothing was staged.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.40,0:16:40.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,想让它们照样跑一遍，就用 pre-commit run --all-files\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}To exercise them anyway, pre-commit run --all-files.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.50,0:16:41.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.97,0:16:45.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,六个 hook 通过，一个没有文件可查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Six hooks pass, one has no files to check,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.18,0:16:49.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后 black 失败：files were modified by this hook\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then black fails: files were modified by this hook;
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.08,0:16:50.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它重新格式化了 utils.py\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}it reformatted utils.py.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.23,0:16:53.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,快速想一下：接下来跑 flake8\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A quick ponder: flake8 runs next.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.96,0:16:56.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它会报出之前那两个问题吗？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Does it report the two findings it made earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.73,0:17:05.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,不会。文件已经被 black 改写过了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}No. Black had already rewritten the file,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.76,0:17:08.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以 flake8 看到的是干净的代码，就通过了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so flake8 saw clean code and passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.34,0:17:10.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这里的 Failed 不代表代码坏了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Failed here does not mean broken;
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.48,0:17:14.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,意思是 hook 改了文件：看一下改动，再重新暂存\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}it means the hook changed files: look at the change, then re-stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.05,0:17:18.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个额外步骤把这个循环走完：git diff 显示改了什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two extras close the loop: git diff shows the fix;
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.84,0:17:20.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,git add -u 把它重新暂存\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}git add -u re-stages it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.98,0:17:22.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再 commit 一次：七个 hook 通过\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Commit again: seven hooks pass,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.97,0:17:26.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个没东西可查，一个真正的 commit 进入了历史\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}two have nothing to check, and a real commit enters history;
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.82,0:17:28.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，把这个循环走一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}pause and walk the loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.68,0:17:30.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 的最后一个变体\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README's last variant,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.39,0:17:33.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,不带参数的 pre-commit run 只检查暂存的文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}plain pre-commit run, checks only staged files;
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.48,0:17:34.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,全部跳过\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}everything skips.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.03,0:17:37.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后一个演示，是额外的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A last demo, as an extra:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.11,0:17:40.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 sed 加一个没用到的 import 并暂存\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}sed adds and stages an unused import;
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.17,0:17:44.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 Mac 上，把这行 import 放到 service.py 的第一行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}on a Mac, add import os as the first line of service.py
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.73,0:17:47.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在编辑器里改就行，然后执行 git add -u\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}in your editor, then git add -u.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.71,0:17:51.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这次 commit 被拦了两道：black 重新格式化了文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The commit fails twice: black reformats the file,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.59,0:17:55.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,flake8 报出 F401，这是任何格式化工具都修不了的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and flake8 reports F401, which no formatter can fix;
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.72,0:17:58.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,git status 确认 commit 没有生成\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}git status confirms no commit exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.97,0:18:03.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把文件取消暂存、再恢复原样，两份都要：你的电脑现在会说不了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Unstage and restore the file, both copies: your machine now says no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.68,0:18:06.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,可这个门禁一个测试都没跑过\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}But this gate never ran a single test.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.44,0:18:10.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,客座讲座会搭一个会跑测试的门禁，再看看连它也会漏掉什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The guest lecture builds one that does, and shows what even it can miss.
